  {
   "section": "simple-text",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "A day where AI, business and Digital Experience connect"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "AI is changing how organizations operate, engage with customers, and make decisions. Conclusion Connect provides a forum to discuss practical experiences, exchange perspectives, and learn from organizations that are already putting AI into practice."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": ": learn from organizations that have successfully scaled AI across operations, customer engagement, and digital experiences"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Real-world AI applications"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": ": connect directly with C-level executives and digital leaders from leading enterprises facing the same challenges you do"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Strategic peer exchange"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": ": leave with concrete strategies, proven frameworks, and ideas you can apply immediately within your own organization"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Actionable insights"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "After a full day of insights and connections, the evening is yours. Join us for an exclusive dinner and drinks - because the best conversations often happen after the last session."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "An evening full of networking:"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "Whether you're early in your AI journey or looking to accelerate adoption, Conclusion Connect gives you the perspectives and connections to move faster and smarter."
    }
   ],
